angerous zones, battle aggressive robots \ud83e\udd16, loot rare weapons and gear \ud83d\udc8e, and escape alive \ud83d\udeaa.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Core Gameplay Loop:\n\nFight \u2694\ufe0f \u2013 Engage intense VR combat against deadly machines\nLoot \ud83d\udcb0 \u2013 Collect weapons, resources, and rare items\nExtract \ud83d\udeaa \u2013 Make it out alive\u2026 or risk losing everything\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Play Smart:\nEvery decision matters - go deeper for bigger loot or extract early to stay safe. Strategy is as important as your aim!\n\n\ud83d\udcb8 Free to Play:\nJump in without barriers and start your raids immediately.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Why You\u2019ll Love RAIDERS BREAKOUT:\n\nImmersive VR gunplay \ud83d\udd2b\nHigh-risk, high-reward extraction runs \ud83d\udd25\nConstant tension and replayability \u267b\ufe0f\nRobots that fight back intelligently \ud83e\udd16\n\n\ud83d\udca5 Enter. Raid. Extract. Repeat.\n\nJoin Discord - https://discord.gg/UFnWEqJBx", "short_description": "\ud83d\udd25 RAIDERS BREAKOUT - VR Extraction Shooter! \ud83e\udd16\nFight deadly robots \u2694\ufe0f, loot valuable gear \ud83d\udcb0, and extract before it\u2019s too late \ud83d\udeaa. Free to play!\n\nJoin Discord - https://discord.gg/UFnWEqJBx"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/raiders-breakout-privacy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Blackbeard Enterprises", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://shrouded-ringer-a1d.notion.site/Raiders-Breakout-336292b9e84880e889bac922fb8205e0?source=copy_link", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null,